  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge and CRP-GS introduce advanced methods for 3DGS that address challenges in sparse view synthesis, while LG-HCC improves compression efficiency. Both frameworks enhance 3D reconstruction accuracy and reduce computational demands.",
