      "statement": "CRP-GS proposes a rate-distortion optimized compression framework that reduces redundancy in 3DGS.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "LG-HCC introduces Neighborhood-Aware Anchor Pruning (NAAP) and a lightweight Geometry-Guided Convolution (GG-Conv) operator for improved compression.",
